# Domain glossary (must)

- **Persona** — identity + expediente + KYC/KYB/PLD (PM/PF/CC child).
- **VERIFICADA ≠ ACTIVA** — Maak verifies Persona; core/SICLI-transition activates Account.
- **Case** — HITL work unit; may close while Account is still activating.
- **Gap** — blocking pending item; **IntakeLink** = write-only client token.
- **Control / Rule / Template** — evaluator config; preview impact before publish.
- **PersonaOK** — event when VERIFICADA; downstream adapter or core — not SPEI.
- Ownership: Maak ≠ Core/Xook/EF/COE/SICLI — see `docs/engineering/DOMAIN.md`.
